      <row>
        <entry>
          <para/>
        </entry>
        <entry>
            <para/>
        </entry>
      </row>
    </tbody>
  </tgroup></table>
  

<para/><item>Multiply 10✕15 using an area model. Find two different ways to partition the 10x15 rectangle. Use the sim to support you in filling out this table. 💬</item>




